Material Design 3 guidance at https://m3.material.io/ by Google, used under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Changes: rewritten in our own words, condensed, reorganized, and combined with token values
extracted from the source repositories below. Each note lists the pages it was written from.

